<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Merita started outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merita started outperform.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Investment Bank Goldman Sachs initiated coverage on June 30 of Finnish banking group Merita with a market outperformer rating, Goldman London analyst Susan Leadem told Reuters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Merita on Monday closed at 17.30 markka and added 0.40 to 17.70 markka by 1245/0945 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Goldman's forecast Merita's full-year 1997 earnings per share at 2.3 markka, and 1998 EPS at 2.2 markka, Leadem said.</p>
<p>In 1996, Merita posted 1.19 markka EPS.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
